{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-48","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：二项无理线段与线段","englishTitle":"To find the first binomial straight line.","book":10,"number":48,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.48","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.48/","group":"prop_2","sourceNumber":48,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","contentId":"euclid-10-48","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3064f9520c9c1a91cb2516e222c31a3c78eb689194106f75e3c30baf84c10e97","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-48.statement","euclid-10-48.construction.1","euclid-10-48.proof.1","euclid-10-48.construction.2","euclid-10-48.proof.2","euclid-10-48.proof.3","euclid-10-48.proof.4","euclid-10-48.proof.5","euclid-10-48.proof.6","euclid-10-48.proof.7","euclid-10-48.construction.3","euclid-10-48.proof.8","euclid-10-48.proof.9","euclid-10-48.proof.10","euclid-10-48.proof.11","euclid-10-48.conclusion","euclid-10-48.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-48.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8edce81fe322dd669400a14feb0210ed5724d535a2dc5651f9bbacec8ae0c75c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find the first binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"找到第一个二项无理线段直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23dc82e84ac95fc5c2ea54efa85d82a7fb314869cd5b47333a42be6945a29cb2","citations":["euclid-10-28"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let two numbers AC, CB be set out such that the sum of them AB has to BC the ratio which a square number has to a square number, but has not to CA the ratio which a square number has to a square number; [[Lemma I after X. 28](/principles/euclid-10-28)] let any rational straight line D be set out, and let EF be commensurable in length with D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出两个数字AC,CB,AB和BC,即平方数和平方数的比,但不超过CA;列出任何有理线段,D,EF和D的比；上述对应量可公度。 [[引理 I after X. 28](/principles/euclid-10-28)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bbcbff26409254158727b8b1ba4cd2273b095cee4d26d838142ca4eeb78e7db7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EF is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EF也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e0b82138d5aba11b679c3f8022fd6c6610a3ec4926723dd2f536b8075c3407f0","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived that, as the number BA is to AC, so is the square on EF to the square on FG. [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设BA对AC的比等于EF对BA对正方形的比。（相关点与线段：FG） [[X. 6, Por.](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f9a8ccbcff933dd15b2c32146dae5a209fec48dd6cadca347704c4d2bc9bd80d","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB has to AC the ratio which a number has to a number; therefore the square on EF also has to the square on FG the ratio which a number has to a number, so that the square on EF is commensurable with the square on FG. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,AB比AC,数字是EF比正方形,数字是FG比正方形,数字是EF比正方形,因此,EF比正方形比可公度。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7c6a45823431fce900ed60ca7184749bf29a5eee21901bc8990ec1087951f995","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And EF is rational; therefore FG is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EF是有理,FG也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"59034f6880d01c65ce251d3a6a3990a7b0db9da900e328e41d791c739da033ab","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BA has not to AC the ratio which a square number has to a square number. neither, therefore, has the square on EF to the square on FG the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore EF is incommensurable in length with FG. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA与平方数之比没有AC之比,平方数与平方数之比为平方数之比为平方数之比为平方数之比为FG之比为正方形之比为正方形之比为正方形之比为平方数之比为平方数之比为平方数之比为FG之比为EF之比为正方形之比为正方形之比为平方数之比为EF；上述对应量不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ff81783a84a71bc71c7b84ddf80bf547791ad2684d34a34137d7677af28712a","citations":["euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EF, FG are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore EG is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EF,FG是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;EG是二项无理线段。 [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"31d16c55ce0eb783ee78ffe48dd9fda6410af0ffb7cd4d1777e41d25191d4893","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that it is also a first binomial straight line."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,这也是第一个二项无理线段直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ba89e4b94e4ba1478e9cdfd2ed24f0f4511daca37f7a69ca6a0a2670fc6db85f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as the number BA is to AC, so is the square on EF to the square on FG, while BA is greater than AC, therefore the square on EF is also greater than the square on FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BA对AC的比相当于EF对BA对正方形的比,FG对正方形的比,BA对AC的比则大于AC,因此EF对正方形的比也大于FG对正方形的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":10,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0771cbb1950480309536f7cedfb8105f4a04be0ec000d9ccc49a7aea753f1a01","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let then the squares on FG, H be equal to the square on EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG,H,正方形等于正方形,EF,FG"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ce1886cfc378a7606cb00c2d47f25933a1e9ee451ec54dcdd82a2fad66ff23e","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now since, as BA is to AC, so is the square on EF to the square on FG, therefore, convertendo, as AB is to BC, so is the square on EF to the square on H. [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为 BA 与 AC 之比等于以 EF 为边的正方形与以 FG 为边的正方形之比，所以变换比例后，AB 与 BC 之比等于以 EF 为边的正方形与以 H 为边的正方形之比。 [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"263ab4e2a5bc890ff3af81ed5d2c32f28fa0c956272dd9687d246e968f4f5e20","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But AB has to BC the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore the square on EF also has to the square on H the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AB比平方数比平方数比平方数,EF比正方形比正方形比H比平方数比平方数比平方数。（相关点与线段：BC）"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"33ffd1c8e349a52535a4ba9cc96953dc501c8ca8a1480d9598111be5e9d636aa","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EF is commensurable in length with H; [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)] therefore the square on EF is greater than the square on FG by the square on a straight line commensurable with EF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EF是长度可公度,H;EF是正方形,比FG的正方形,比可公度和EF直线上的正方形要多。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ac77aad85d1979718abc2a7cff02c48a67d31df510cbf84c3b9dab774f3b397","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And EF, FG are rational, and EF is commensurable in length with D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"EF,FG是有理,EF是长度可公度,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"499b4adbaf08ad89b95f70e0e21bd1007c6894472b6fda8109834f4580408772","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore EF is a first binomial straight line. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,EF是第一个二项无理线段直线,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-48.source","contentId":"euclid-10-48","revisionId":"euclid-10-48@raw-3064f9520c9c1a91","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"179c659bbb53db0d9614bd118913e40c0dd514a2f70d134baa19e537f341ce0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.48/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.48\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-48:euclid-10-28:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-48","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-48.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-28","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.48","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.48/","sourceLabel":"Lemma I after X. 28"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-48:euclid-10-6:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-48","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-48.construction.2","euclid-10-48.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-6","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_2.48","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.pers